dsh-chat-shell README · What it does：* the DSH session, its scroll position and any running tool call are untouched;
* every AI website stays mounted, so an answer that is still being generated
  keeps generating while you are looking at Harness;
* each site has its own session partition, so three logins do not overwrite each
  other.

dsh-chat-shell README · How it works：```js
  const { lease, partition } = await window.dshDesktop.browser.acquire("chat-shell:" + site.id);
  const view = document.createElement("webview");
  view.setAttribute("name", lease);
  view.setAttribute("partition", partition);

dsh-chat-shell README · 实现要点：```js
  const { lease, partition } = await window.dshDesktop.browser.acquire("chat-shell:" + site.id);
  const view = document.createElement("webview");
  view.setAttribute("name", lease);
  view.setAttribute("partition", partition);

外壳只接受 `src` 为 `about:blank#<lease>` 的 webview，并会自己覆盖 web preferences，
  所以元素写错只会被拒绝，而不会悄悄用另一套权限跑起来。
* 配色从当前页面实时读取（`getComputedStyle`），折算成一组 CSS 自定义属性；App 换主题时
  通过 `MutationObserver`（`<html>`/`<body>`）与 `prefers-color-scheme` 重算。
* 没有构建步骤，没有依赖，自己也不发任何网络请求。
